, first Count of Haro, one of the most powerful personalities of the 15th century, well known as a statesman, independant scholar, poet, and bibliophile.</dc:description><dc:format>301 ff., 23 x 33 cm</dc:format><dc:identifier>doi:10.5076/e-codices-fmb-cb-0045</dc:identifier><dc:identifier>http://www.e-codices.unifr.ch/en/list/one/fmb/cb-0045</dc:identifier><dc:identifier>Cologny, Fondation Martin Bodmer, Cod. Bodmer 45</dc:identifier><dc:publisher>e-codices - Virtual Manuscript Library of Switzerland</dc:publisher><dc:language>Spanish</dc:language><dc:relation>Dutton Brian, El cancionero del siglo XV, c. 1360-1520. I. Manuscritos Barcelona, Ateneo (BA) - Madrid, Biblioteca March (MM), Salamanca, Biblioteca Española del Siglo XV, Universidad de Salamanca, 1990, 79-93.</dc:relation><dc:rights>e-codices / Cologny, Fondation Martin Bodmer (cf. http://www.e-codices.unifr.ch/en/about/terms)</dc:rights><dc:source rdf:resource="http://www.e-codices.unifr.ch/en/list/one/fmb/cb-0045"></dc:source><dc:title>Cologny, Fondation Martin Bodmer, Cod. Bodmer 45 : Cancioneiro de Pedro Fernandez de Velasco. Diversas Virtudes y vicios y Yinnos</dc:title><dc:type>Manuscript</dc:type><dcterms:medium>Parchment</dcterms:medium><edm:europeanaProxy>false</edm:europeanaProxy><ore:proxyFor rdf:resource="http://data.europeana.eu/item/9200211/en_list_one_fmb_cb_0045"/><ore:proxyIn rdf:resource="http://data.europeana.eu/aggregation/provider/9200211/en_list_one_fmb_cb_0045"/><edm:type>TEXT</edm:type></ore:Proxy><edm:EuropeanaAggregation rdf:about="http://data.europeana.eu/aggregation/europeana/9200211/en_list_one_fmb_cb_0045"><edm:aggregatedCHO rdf:resource="http://data.europeana.eu/item/9200211/en_list_one_fmb_cb_0045"/><edm:datasetName>9200211_Ag_EU_e-Codices</edm:datasetName><edm:country>Switzerland</edm:country><edm:preview rdf:resource="http://www.e-codices.unifr.ch/loris/fmb/fmb-cb-0045/fmb-cb-0045_004r.jp2/full/full/0/default.jpg"/><edm:landingPage rdf:resource="https://www.europeana.eu/ite